{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1084970/extras/f631a2fdd62e40eb089787322de874fb.avif?t=1667043534\" width=612 height=200 /></span><br><br>Bridge Builder Racer is the ultimate test for both your engineering and driving skills. You'll have to build your bridge using the most cost effective route, and then drive your car over the bridge to go from point A to B. Each level has a total of 3 stars to be earned. Spending less money gives you a higher star rating. Can you beat all levels with 3 stars?<br><br><strong>Build your bridge</strong><br>The first stage of each level is to build your bridge.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1084970/extras/d68317acacb126b967edada64d3785af.poster.avif?t=1667043534\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1084970/extras/d68317acacb126b967edada64d3785af.webm?t=1667043534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1084970/extras/d68317acacb126b967edada64d3785af.mp4?t=1667043534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Race your bridge</strong><br>After building the bridge, you'll manually control the car to go over your newly created bridge.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1084970/extras/9553240287491bf8fd4e24e8bc6dbe43.poster.avif?t=1667043534\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1084970/extras/9553240287491bf8fd4e24e8bc6dbe43.webm?t=1667043534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1084970/extras/9553240287491bf8fd4e24e8bc6dbe43.mp4?t=1667043534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Challenge your friends</strong><br>With the implementation of Steam Leadersboards, you can challenge your friends and see who's the best at both building, and driving!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1084970/extras/9474138f4b7530692e782fac9e631d5d.avif?t=1667043534\" width=612 height=458 /></span><br><br><strong>Steam workshop</strong><br>Create, share and play maps created by the community!<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over 60 challenging levels<br></li><li> Beautiful low-poly landscapes<br></li><li> Realistic car physics (kinda)<br></li><li> 2 game modes<br></li><li> Intuitive controls<br></li><li> Steam Leaderboards<br></li><li> Steam Achievements<br></li><li> Steam Workshop and map editor</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"229b9c6cb3d2a0d1f69f703a71fe97734d973021.jpg","localized_name":"Bridge Builder","name":"Bridge Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1084970/229b9c6cb3d2a0d1f69f703a71fe97734d973021.jpg"},{"icon":"3895e0895c5e14fd709a47aef75e0a53e2f584cc.jpg","localized_name":"Advanced Bridge Builder","name":"Advanced Bridge Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1084970/3895e0895c5e14fd709a47aef75e0a53e2f584cc.jpg"},{"icon":"6a1b4a576aec6570837e908daf00f42c34371a8c.jpg","localized_name":"Expert Bridge Builder","name":"Expert Bridge Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1084970/6a1b4a576aec6570837e908daf00f42c34371a8c.jpg"},{"icon":"27098e87c781b60030113156b30f04509028d91d.jpg","localized_name":"Look mom, no money!","name":"Look mom, no money!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1084970/27098e87c781b60030113156b30f04509028d91d.j